<div style="padding: 2rem; font-family: system-ui; max-width: 640px;">
  <h3 style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Brand icons are populated by a one-time export from Figma.</h3>
  <p style="margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 0.875rem; color: #555;">
    Run the exporter with a Figma personal access token
    (<a href="https://www.figma.com/settings">get one here</a>):
  </p>
  <pre style="background: #f3f3f3; padding: 1rem; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.8rem; overflow-x: auto;">FIGMA_ACCESS_TOKEN=xxx ruby script/export_brand_icons.rb</pre>
  <p style="margin-top: 1rem; font-size: 0.875rem; color: #555;">
    SVGs are written to <code>app/assets/images/shipwright/brand/</code> and loaded automatically
    on next app boot. Rendering without a matching SVG raises <code>ArgumentError</code> with the
    full list of available icons.
  </p>
</div>
